   "id": "nico",
   "clip": 10,
   "text": "The idea is simple, look at what people can actually do. I took inspiration from Centrale Lyon, a French engineering school where skills are assessed through practical situations. I adapted that approach to recruitment. First, define the skills the job needs. Then, assess them through short exercises before the event and during the interview. Use those results to help connect the right candidates with the right opportunities. AI helps with the exercises and the feedback. The recruiter reviews the results and makes the final decision.",
